cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research record (experiment methodology, RTL,
  simulators, or reported results), please cite it as below. For the
  maintained MEMBRANE runtime itself, cite kadireren7/membrane instead.
title: "MEMBRANE Research: experiment record, simulators, and exploratory RTL"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Altıntaş"
    given-names: "Kadir Eren"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kadireren7/membrane-research"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Full research record for MEMBRANE, a mixed-precision KV-cache and
  exact-retrieval decision engine for LLM inference: phased experiment
  documentation, out-of-core and CXL/near-memory simulators, exploratory
  FPGA divider/scheduler RTL and cosimulation testbenches, the project
  paper, and outreach materials. Every result in this repository is
  labeled MEASURED_BY_TOOL, SIMULATED, ESTIMATED, or UNAVAILABLE — see
  the top-level README and each experiment's own methodology.md for the
  classification discipline. This repository holds research evidence and
  exploratory code only; the maintained, production runtime lives in
  kadireren7/membrane and is not duplicated here.
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://github.com/kadireren7/membrane"
    description: "The maintained MEMBRANE runtime this research record supports"
